Version 4
SHEET 1 3600 2000
TEXT 100 40 Left 2 ;========================================================================================
TEXT 100 70 Left 2 ;COMPUTE-IN-MEMORY 4-ROW NEURAL CROSSBAR: 3-BIT STREAMING READOUT WITH SINC-2 FILTERING
