TEXT 100 130 Left 2 ;========================================================================================

* 1. 4-ROW NEURAL CROSSBAR SYNAPTIC ARRAY
TEXT 100 200 Left 2 ;[1. 4-ROW SYNAPSE ARRAY: WORDLINES & CONDUCTANCES]
* Wordline 1: ON (1.0V)
SYMBOL voltage 140 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Vwl1
SYMATTR Value PULSE(1 1 0 10p 10p 60n 60n)
WIRE 140 240 140 276
FLAG 140 240 wl1
WIRE 140 340 140 390
FLAG 140 390 0

SYMBOL bi 260 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Gcell1
SYMATTR Value I=10u*V(wl1)
WIRE 260 240 260 260
FLAG 260 240 vbl
WIRE 260 340 260 390
FLAG 260 390 0

* Wordline 2: Phase 2 Step (Turns ON at 30ns)
SYMBOL voltage 420 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Vwl2
SYMATTR Value PULSE(0 1 30n 50p 50p 30n 60n)
WIRE 420 240 420 276
FLAG 420 240 wl2
WIRE 420 340 420 390
FLAG 420 390 0

SYMBOL bi 540 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Gcell2
SYMATTR Value I=20u*V(wl2)
WIRE 540 240 540 260
FLAG 540 240 vbl
WIRE 540 340 540 390
FLAG 540 390 0

* Wordline 3: ON (1.0V)
SYMBOL voltage 700 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Vwl3
SYMATTR Value PULSE(1 1 0 10p 10p 60n 60n)
WIRE 700 240 700 276
FLAG 700 240 wl3
WIRE 700 340 700 390
FLAG 700 390 0

SYMBOL bi 820 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Gcell3
SYMATTR Value I=15u*V(wl3)
WIRE 820 240 820 260
FLAG 820 240 vbl
WIRE 820 340 820 390
FLAG 820 390 0

* Wordline 4: OFF (0.0V)
SYMBOL voltage 980 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Vwl4
SYMATTR Value 0
WIRE 980 240 980 276
FLAG 980 240 wl4
WIRE 980 340 980 390
FLAG 980 390 0

SYMBOL bi 1100 260 R0
