* 2. SHARED COLUMN BITLINE (INTEGRATOR 1) & 3-BIT DAC
TEXT 1350 200 Left 2 ;[2. COLUMN BITLINE (INTEGRATOR 1) & 3-BIT DAC]
SYMBOL cap 1380 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Cbl
SYMATTR Value 100f
SYMATTR SpiceLine ic=0.25
WIRE 1396 240 1396 286
FLAG 1396 240 vbl
WIRE 1396 334 1396 390
FLAG 1396 390 0

SYMBOL res 1500 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Rbl
SYMATTR Value 500k
WIRE 1516 240 1516 286
FLAG 1516 240 vbl
WIRE 1516 366 1516 390
FLAG 1516 390 0

* Local Resonator Feedback: omitted to preserve negative feedback margin

SYMBOL bi 1780 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Bidac
SYMATTR Value I=50u*((V(y_del)+1.0)/2.0)
WIRE 1780 240 1780 260
FLAG 1780 240 vbl
WIRE 1780 340 1780 390
FLAG 1780 390 0

* 3. SECOND INTEGRATOR: ACTIVE OTA + C2
TEXT 2050 200 Left 2 ;[3. SECOND INTEGRATOR (OTA + C2)]
SYMBOL bv 2100 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Vref_src
SYMATTR Value V=0.25
WIRE 2100 240 2100 276
FLAG 2100 240 ref
WIRE 2100 356 2100 390
FLAG 2100 390 0

SYMBOL bi 2300 260 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName Gota
SYMATTR Value I=100u*(V(vbl)-V(ref))
WIRE 2300 240 2300 260
FLAG 2300 240 v2
WIRE 2300 340 2300 390
FLAG 2300 390 0

SYMBOL cap 2460 270 R0
WINDOW 123 24 16 Left 2
WINDOW 39 24 56 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName C2
SYMATTR Value 400f
SYMATTR SpiceLine ic=0
WIRE 2476 240 2476 286
FLAG 2476 240 v2
WIRE 2476 334 2476 390
FLAG 2476 390 0

SYMBOL res 2580 270 R0
